(6140773, 905270, 117831, '<td valign="top">The image is a tad soft. which makes the glass and water appear to be less than crisp. The glass has a large white spot which makes it appear blown out... there are several people who do glasses and do them spectacular so DPC is used to seeing these and anything less tends to get voted down.</td>', 'The image is a tad soft. which makes the glass and water appear to be less than crisp. The glass has a large white spot which makes it appear blown out... there are several people who do glasses and do them spectacular so DPC is used to seeing these and anything less tends to get voted down.', '2010-08-25 12:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
