(6141332, 905408, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good choice to have the shoe at a slight diagonal. The bright sock stuffed into it helps meet the topic, although the dull yellow of the shoe is not bad. Wonder if a different choice of background color (to contrast instead of to harmonize with the sole) might produce a stronger result.</td>', 'Good choice to have the shoe at a slight diagonal. The bright sock stuffed into it helps meet the topic, although the dull yellow of the shoe is not bad. Wonder if a different choice of background color (to contrast instead of to harmonize with the sole) might produce a stronger result.', '2010-08-25 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
