(6141349, 905267, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good job of having focus point on the eye. Is that the tongue sticking out and bent down to sip nectar? Hope the criteria fanatics aren''t wacking for the orange tone of the moth itself.</td>', 'Good job of having focus point on the eye. Is that the tongue sticking out and bent down to sip nectar? Hope the criteria fanatics aren''t wacking for the orange tone of the moth itself.', '2010-08-25 22:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
