(6141356, 905038, 81362, '<td valign="top">Often I don''t like selective desaturation, but this has enough humor to counteract that. Would consider shooting from more to the side, maybe with head turned, to move the center away from strictly centered and make it more dynamic.</td>', 'Often I don''t like selective desaturation, but this has enough humor to counteract that. Would consider shooting from more to the side, maybe with head turned, to move the center away from strictly centered and make it more dynamic.', '2010-08-25 22:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
