(6141360, 904566, 81362, '<td valign="top">Abstract, a bit of a mess for lines on the pavement, good to have no other colors competing here. Displays on the orange side of yellow on my calibrated monitor.</td>', 'Abstract, a bit of a mess for lines on the pavement, good to have no other colors competing here. Displays on the orange side of yellow on my calibrated monitor.', '2010-08-25 22:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
