(6141669, 905155, 20799, '<td valign="top">In my face! :))) Very nicely done and I really want to know how you did this.</td>', 'In my face! :))) Very nicely done and I really want to know how you did this.', '2010-08-26 04:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141672, 905078, 20799, '<td valign="top">Classic shot! I''m thinking that people might say that the yellow color here is just a color cast, but I know it''s not. I noticed the footsteps in the lower right corner - it''s magic, did something like that myself years ago. Here''s a suggestion, next time try setting the tripod low and let it collect footsteps :). Sorry for the long comment.</td>', 'Classic shot! I''m thinking that people might say that the yellow color here is just a color cast, but I know it''s not. I noticed the footsteps in the lower right corner - it''s magic, did something like that myself years ago. Here''s a suggestion, next time try setting the tripod low and let it collect footsteps :). Sorry for the long comment.', '2010-08-26 04:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141674, 905242, 20799, '<td valign="top">Some day I will learn how to get colors like this out of the image. Front page!</td>', 'Some day I will learn how to get colors like this out of the image. Front page!', '2010-08-26 04:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
