(6141748, 904422, 8171, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful - one of my faves let''s hope others agree and it is placed where it deserves.  A top five for me.</td>', 'Simply beautiful - one of my faves let''s hope others agree and it is placed where it deserves.  A top five for me.', '2010-08-26 07:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141749, 904366, 8171, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  As a Nikon-er I shouldn''t object I guess ;) very creative well done.</td>', 'Ouch!  As a Nikon-er I shouldn''t object I guess ;) very creative well done.', '2010-08-26 07:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141752, 905111, 8171, '<td valign="top">We were always going to get a bunch of flower shots (my own included) but this one stands out from the bunch.  Great saturation, sharpness and depth of subject.  Well done.</td>', 'We were always going to get a bunch of flower shots (my own included) but this one stands out from the bunch.  Great saturation, sharpness and depth of subject.  Well done.', '2010-08-26 07:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141753, 905413, 8171, '<td valign="top">A definite top 5 for me - a great idea very well executed.  Well done.</td>', 'A definite top 5 for me - a great idea very well executed.  Well done.', '2010-08-26 07:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141756, 905135, 117804, '<td valign="top">Like the idea and capture but the background is still too visible...</td>', 'Like the idea and capture but the background is still too visible...', '2010-08-26 08:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141757, 904580, 117804, '<td valign="top">I like the multiple circles...</td>', 'I like the multiple circles...', '2010-08-26 08:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141758, 904383, 117804, '<td valign="top">Fire like...</td>', 'Fire like...', '2010-08-26 08:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141762, 904473, 117804, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but there is too much noise in the picture IMHO...</td>', 'I like the idea but there is too much noise in the picture IMHO...', '2010-08-26 08:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141895, 904566, 10785, '<td valign="top">A very minimalist abstract</td>', 'A very minimalist abstract', '2010-08-26 12:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141896, 905367, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very pleasant and emotive. The soft focus and graininess is totally going against the DPC trends. It works well for this photo. Good luck with the mob.</td>', 'Very pleasant and emotive. The soft focus and graininess is totally going against the DPC trends. It works well for this photo. Good luck with the mob.', '2010-08-26 12:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141899, 905287, 10785, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the subject more prominent in the photo... but you did well with the rule of thirds composition. Every thing is nice and sharp with lots of texture in the grass.</td>', 'I''d like to see the subject more prominent in the photo... but you did well with the rule of thirds composition. Every thing is nice and sharp with lots of texture in the grass.', '2010-08-26 12:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141900, 905373, 96574, '<td valign="top">fantastic shot, great use of dof 8</td>', 'fantastic shot, great use of dof 8', '2010-08-26 12:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141901, 905352, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very good composition!</td>', 'Very good composition!', '2010-08-26 12:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141902, 905408, 10785, '<td valign="top">I don''t think there is a need to use a shallow depth of field here. I would go with a smaller aperture to bring everything into focus.</td>', 'I don''t think there is a need to use a shallow depth of field here. I would go with a smaller aperture to bring everything into focus.', '2010-08-26 12:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141903, 905417, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice set up. There is just too much negative space. I would recompose to fill the frame with the target and the arrow using a less straight on perspective.</td>', 'Nice set up. There is just too much negative space. I would recompose to fill the frame with the target and the arrow using a less straight on perspective.', '2010-08-26 12:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141906, 905355, 86799, '<td valign="top">Clever, but the screw-end and paint might be a little more prominent to make the point stronger.  Maybe rotated toward the camera a little more?</td>', 'Clever, but the screw-end and paint might be a little more prominent to make the point stronger.  Maybe rotated toward the camera a little more?', '2010-08-26 12:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141926, 905270, 99263, '<td valign="top">I think this is very nicely executed. Good clarity and nice tones of yellow. Sharp detail. I like the way the water drops into the glass and how it stands out against the background. The composition is also good and fits nicely into the elongated portrait frame. I was in 2 minds about whether it would have been even better to have the entire wineglass, stem and all in the frame but I realized that the image would then have been smaller and the nice close-up detail would have been lost. So I think this is just perfect and it''s a very good effort. I give it a 6.</td>', 'I think this is very nicely executed. Good clarity and nice tones of yellow. Sharp detail. I like the way the water drops into the glass and how it stands out against the background. The composition is also good and fits nicely into the elongated portrait frame. I was in 2 minds about whether it would have been even better to have the entire wineglass, stem and all in the frame but I realized that the image would then have been smaller and the nice close-up detail would have been lost. So I think this is just perfect and it''s a very good effort. I give it a 6.', '2010-08-26 13:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141942, 905343, 117927, '<td valign="top">Love the colors. Well done!</td>', 'Love the colors. Well done!', '2010-08-26 13:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141980, 905219, 101702, '<td valign="top">My pick for the blue!</td>', 'My pick for the blue!', '2010-08-26 14:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6141989, 905099, 92577, '<td valign="top">this one caught my eye - very good<br/>( there are several ways in which you could have made the paint a closer match color-wise but its great just the same.)</td>', 'this one caught my eye - very good( there are several ways in which you could have made the paint a closer match color-wise but its great just the same.)', '2010-08-26 14:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
