(6142282, 904829, 86322, '<td valign="top">Great use of this technique. Love the selecting color in this one. Wouldve loved to see the top part not being cut off from the frame. 9</td>', 'Great use of this technique. Love the selecting color in this one. Wouldve loved to see the top part not being cut off from the frame. 9', '2010-08-26 20:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
