(6142587, 905274, 94241, '<td valign="top">Beautiful gentleman, amazing face.  Not at all how I would have finished it in post.  I''d suggest cropping in a lot closer on his face -- his rump is just wasted space in this shot.  The colors also seem a little muted, perhaps a bit more saturation, a little less contrast (blacks seem kind of chunked up), and adjust hue a bit more towards yellow.  Since this is advanced editing, you could even paint out the background to black if you wanted, to really make him pop.</td>', 'Beautiful gentleman, amazing face.  Not at all how I would have finished it in post.  I''d suggest cropping in a lot closer on his face -- his rump is just wasted space in this shot.  The colors also seem a little muted, perhaps a bit more saturation, a little less contrast (blacks seem kind of chunked up), and adjust hue a bit more towards yellow.  Since this is advanced editing, you could even paint out the background to black if you wanted, to really make him pop.', '2010-08-27 03:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
