(6146407, 905063, 103032, '<td valign="top">There are two like this.  I like them both for different reasons.  I like this one for it''s closer framing and the color tones on the skin.  Nice portrait.</td>', 'There are two like this.  I like them both for different reasons.  I like this one for it''s closer framing and the color tones on the skin.  Nice portrait.', '2010-08-31 04:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6146409, 905219, 103032, '<td valign="top">As I commented on the other similar portrait, I like both for different reasons.  I think you caught the eye contact wonderfully in this shot.  But I favor the closer framing of the other one.  This is also nice.  It''s a toss up, I think both will do very well.</td>', 'As I commented on the other similar portrait, I like both for different reasons.  I think you caught the eye contact wonderfully in this shot.  But I favor the closer framing of the other one.  This is also nice.  It''s a toss up, I think both will do very well.', '2010-08-31 04:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6146436, 904657, 105620, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Love the clarity .<br/> <br/>THE  EYE HAS IT !</td>', 'Great shot. Love the clarity . THE  EYE HAS IT !', '2010-08-31 05:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6146486, 905066, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good choice. Interesting that the repeating arches give a sense of calm and contemplation despite the color.</td>', 'Good choice. Interesting that the repeating arches give a sense of calm and contemplation despite the color.', '2010-08-31 08:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
