(6147781, 905064, 86218, '<td valign="top">You are very creative in your ideas for challenges..even radical at times :) LOL at your wife. Can even see this happening in front of me. My kids would have had a ball doing this to me..no sorry''s from them. It''s just the rounding off that lacks a bit.<br/>1) green cast on the fluid - small nit Some PS could maybe have corrected this?<br/>2) Skin tone/lighting on you<br/>3) placing of "water" on you. Something you dont have control over and luck plays a major part in this<br/> <br/>These are my nits and Im being hyper critical. I could never have done this better even if I tried. In all honesty I would have been out of frame every time...ducking. You truly are a sucker..lol<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-09-01 02:34:38.</i></td>', 'You are very creative in your ideas for challenges..even radical at times :) LOL at your wife. Can even see this happening in front of me. My kids would have had a ball doing this to me..no sorry''s from them. It''s just the rounding off that lacks a bit.1) green cast on the fluid - small nit Some PS could maybe have corrected this?2) Skin tone/lighting on you3) placing of "water" on you. Something you dont have control over and luck plays a major part in this These are my nits and Im being hyper critical. I could never have done this better even if I tried. In all honesty I would have been out of frame every time...ducking. You truly are a sucker..lol', '2010-09-01 03:33:41.000000', '2010-09-01 03:34:38.000000', 0),
