(6148612, 905269, 115674, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for the comments! <br/>My little prince is growing fast... He´s started eating solids few weeks ago, so I´m all into baby food. When I saw that the challenge of the week was yellow I could only think of mango purée, which he loves (specially on this occasion, when I let him make all the mess he wished!).<br/> <br/>To bob350: Yes, I know, I was not totally satisfied with the angle, but there was no way I could turn more the chair towards the window that my refrigerator wouldn´t come to the frame... As he was hungry (saying "gimme, gimme!!" in his baby language), I didn´t have much time for further testing and experimenting!  But thanks for your observation, really appreciated!</td>', 'Thanks all for the comments! My little prince is growing fast... He´s started eating solids few weeks ago, so I´m all into baby food. When I saw that the challenge of the week was yellow I could only think of mango purée, which he loves (specially on this occasion, when I let him make all the mess he wished!). To bob350: Yes, I know, I was not totally satisfied with the angle, but there was no way I could turn more the chair towards the window that my refrigerator wouldn´t come to the frame... As he was hungry (saying "gimme, gimme!!" in his baby language), I didn´t have much time for further testing and experimenting!  But thanks for your observation, really appreciated!', '2010-09-01 14:31:12.000000', NULL, 0),
